@page "/about"

<div class="home-container">
    <h1>About Look Up</h1>

    <p>It's a minimalist project that scans the Bitcoin blockchain for human-readable messages in transactions.</p>
    <p>This page lets you search and find for your messages on the blockchain via Transaction ID, Hex or Date.</p>

    <div class="disclaimer">
        <p>Disclaimer: Messages on the blockchain don't automatically become true or the truth. On important topics, please make your own research.</p>
        <p>Engraving the truth onto the blockchain is easy and simple. Engraving lies is just as easy and simple.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Technology Stack</h2>
    <div class="tech-stack">
        <ul>
            <li>C#</li>
            <li>Entity Framework</li>
            <li>PostgreSQL</li>
            <li>Blazor</li>
            <li>HTML5/CSS3</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
